MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_001: Listen to this, Bucephalus. One of the gals I work\nwith just started going steady with someone.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_002: She seems so...happy. Like she can't stop smiling,\neven if she tried. I'd like that to be me someday...
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_003: Hey, hey. What's wrong? Steady now...\nDid something spook you, there?
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_004: Sorry, Alexandra. I think I might have startled him.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_005: Cai! What are you doing here? You didn't overhear\nany of that, did you?!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_006: No! Not really. I just got here.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_007: I saw they're done putting out fodder at the stables,\nand I wanted to let you know.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_008: Don't worry, I didn't hear anything about that\ngoing-steady stuff you were talking about.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_009: So you did hear me. Please just forget about it, OK?
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_010: Whoa! Don't hurt me, Bucephalus! Alexandra, stop\nhim! I swear I won't tell anyone!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_011: Whew! He calmed down. He's still looking at me\nkinda funny, though.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_012: I'm so sorry! I can't believe he tried to bite you.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_013: He can be a tad overprotective. I think Bucephalus\nconsiders me his little sister or something.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_014: A little sister, huh? So, not like a keeper?
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_015: Well, he was a gift from my parents. They bought\nhim for me before they died.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_016: Bucephalus was there while I grieved. One second I'd\nbe brushing him and then suddenly burst out crying.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_017: He licked the tears from my cheek and became an\nirreplaceable part of my family.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_018: You two have a great bond.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_019: It's nice to hear you say that. My superiors didn't\nsee it as such a good thing.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_020: They'd say, "It's important for a temple knight to \ncherish their pegasus, but you're too attached."
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_021: Really? But caring about others helps us team up so\nwe can be more effective.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_022: Right! And Bucephalus and I are an amazing team!\nNo other knight and her steed come close.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_023: Exactly! That's something only you can give us.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_024: And since he's such an important member of your\nfamily, I'd like to be his friend.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_025: That would be wonderful. Come on, Bucephalus.\nCome say hi to Cai...
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_C_026: Aww, he's not quite sure what to think of me yet.\nI wonder how we can become friends.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_001: Excuse me! Sorry! I need to get through!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_002: Alexandra! Wait up!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_003: What's the matter? You look like you've seen a ghost.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_004: Cai! It's Bucephalus... He's gone...
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_005: This has never happened before. I don't know what\nto do!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_006: Hey, it'll be alright. I'll help you look for him.\nAny idea where he might have gone?
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_007: Thank...thank you. Um, there's a hill nearby. He\nlikes the flowers there.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_008: Oh, great! We can get there in no time. And don't\nworry. I'm sure we'll find him.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_009: Hmm... He's not here. Any other ideas?
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_010: No. This is terrible. Humiliating even. How does a\nknight lose her own pegasus?
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_011: I'm sorry. You probably don't want to get caught up\nin all this, Cai.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_012: Oh, come on. I don't mind at all.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_013: Maybe, but I shouldn't impose on you any more than\nI already have.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_014: Today was a bust. I'll get a friend to help me look\nagain in the morning.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_015: What? You can't stop looking!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_016: You said Bucephalus is like family. We can't give up!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_017: Cai...
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_018: You're right. I won't give up!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_019: We'll keep looking. I mean, you'll help me, right?
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_020: Of course. So where else might he be?
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_021: I got it! You said he likes the flowers here.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_022: I've seen flowers just like them!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_023: Really? Where?!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_024: Follow me!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_025: There he is! Bucephalus!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_026: Hey! You really had me worried there. *sob*
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_B_027: Whew! I'm so glad you two are reunited.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_001: Alexandra! Out for a stroll with Bucephalus again?
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_002: Yeah! Actually, we've been looking for you.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_003: I wanted to thank you again for helping me find\nhim when he got out.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_004: Honestly, I'm not sure I could ever thank you enough.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_005: Aw, no need to make a fuss. I'm glad I could\nhelp you.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_006: That's very kind, but this beast has caused his fair\nshare of trouble for you.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_007: I still can't believe he bolted out of the stables for\nsuch a dumb reason.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_008: What dumb reason was that?
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_009: Well, after he escaped I took him to the doctor, just\nin case, and he got a clean bill of health.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_010: But I was telling the doctor about how he nipped\nyou, and he said it's...jealousy.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_011: Apparently running off was his way of asking for\nattention! It's kind of embarrassing.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_012: Everything's fine now, though. No need to fret\nabout it.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_013: It looks like Bucephalus agrees! Think he's warming\nup to me?
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_014: It's because you helped me find him. He knows\nhe can trust you.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_015: But I'm pretty sure there are less troublesome ways\nto bond with someone.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_016: I don't mind. I was hoping we'd be friends.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_017: It's a relief to hear you say that, Cai.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_018: If you think about it, he wouldn't have been so upset\nif you two weren't so close.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_019: There's no way anything I do could ever change that.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_020: Yeah, you agree with me, don't you Bucephalus?\nYou and I ought to go for a swim sometime!
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_021: Just you and Bucephalus? I'd love to get to know you\na bit better too.
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_022: What?! More attitude! Did you see that, Cai? What\nwas that face he just made?
MID_SE_Kai_Ale_A_023: Huh? I must've missed it. Let's just make sure the\nthree of us keep getting along together.